Read the start of this C++ file from an inference engine. Summarise how the expert pool decides, per routed entry, whether an expert is computed on the GPU, over PCIe, or on the CPU, and list the functions involved.

```cpp
// src/core/expert_source.cpp - the adapter.  See the header for the three clauses of the contract.
